{"id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-representable.md","title":"Representable Functor","display":"df-representable — Representable Functor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-representable","aliases":["58-df-representable","Representable Functor"],"display":"df-representable — Representable Functor","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-representable</span><span>Representable Functor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-representable — Representable Functor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877f1061e295cf5f\" href=\"?note=877f1061e295cf5f\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-functor.md\">../batch18/58-df-functor.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"970e2b8779070da0\" href=\"?note=970e2b8779070da0\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md\">../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e637becf421e4e61\" href=\"?note=e637becf421e4e61\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-category-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C,F,h,\\eta,A,\\xi\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C,F,h,\\eta,A,\\xi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S\\)</span> (upstream predicates)</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)=C_0\">\\(\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)=C_0\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S,\\operatorname{Representable}_S,\\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S,\\operatorname{Representable}_S,\\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(h,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;(h(X)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A))\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,A)\\;(h(f^{\\operatorname{op}})(g)=g\\circ f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(h,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;(h(X)=\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A))\\land\\forall X,Y\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Y,A)\\;(h(f^{\\operatorname{op}})(g)=g\\circ f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\varepsilon,G,F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal A)\\;(\\varepsilon_X\\circ\\eta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\land\\eta_X\\circ\\varepsilon_X=\\operatorname{id}_{G(X)})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal B)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,F,G,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\land\\exists\\varepsilon\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\varepsilon,G,F,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B)\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal A)\\;(\\varepsilon_X\\circ\\eta_X=\\operatorname{id}_{F(X)}\\land\\eta_X\\circ\\varepsilon_X=\\operatorname{id}_{G(X)})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S(F,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\exists h,\\eta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S(\\eta,h,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S(F,A,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Functor}_S(F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\exists h,\\eta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S(\\eta,h,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{Representable}_S(F,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S(F,A,\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{Representable}_S(F,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S(F,A,\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\xi,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists h\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\xi\\in F(A)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,h,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\;(\\eta_X(g)=F(g^{\\operatorname{op}})(\\xi))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S(\\eta,A,F,\\xi,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\exists h\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\xi\\in F(A)\\land\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S(\\eta,h,F,\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}},\\mathbf{Set})\\land\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\forall g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\;(\\eta_X(g)=F(g^{\\operatorname{op}})(\\xi))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file uses the presheaf convention <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\">\\(F:\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}}\\to\\mathbf{Set}\\)</span>, so the representing functor is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(-,A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The category contract is now the same six-component <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S\\)</span> contract required by the upstream functor predicate.</li>\n<li>The last assertion records the variance in the Yoneda correspondence: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:X\\to A\">\\(g:X\\to A\\)</span> induces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(g^{\\operatorname{op}}):F(A)\\to F(X)\">\\(F(g^{\\operatorname{op}}):F(A)\\to F(X)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Enriched representable: in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-category, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-valued functors; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-natural isomorphism</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-functor.md","status":"resolved","id":"877f1061e295cf5f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-functor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md","status":"resolved","id":"970e2b8779070da0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-natural-transformation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-category-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"e637becf421e4e61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C,F,h,\\eta,A,\\xi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S,\\mathrm{Functor}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalTransformation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)=C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S,\\mathrm{NaturalIso}_S,\\operatorname{Representable}_S,\\operatorname{RepresentedBy}_S,\\operatorname{YonedaElement}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}representable} \\vdash \\mathrm{HomPresheaf}_S(h,A,\\mathcal